# 1. Co zajmuje dysk worker teraz (obrazy i top 10 podów)
oc get --raw /api/v1/nodes/worker/proxy/stats/summary | jq '{fs: .node.fs, image: .node.runtime.imageFs,
  top: ([.pods[] | {p: (.podRef.namespace + "/" + .podRef.name), used: .["ephemeral-storage"].usedBytes}] | sort_by(.used // 0) | reverse | .[:10])}'

